{"id":"9d2fad00ef7ed0b2","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-df-barrel.md","title":"Barrel","display":"df-barrel — Barrel","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-barrel","aliases":["58-df-barrel","Barrel"],"display":"df-barrel — Barrel","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md]]","[[../batch14/58-df-topology.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-barrel"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-barrel</span><span>Barrel</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-barrel — Barrel"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\in V\">\\(B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\in V\\)</span> (参数)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}\">\\(\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}\\)</span> (向量空间谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"592f9cfb66a507c2\" href=\"?note=592f9cfb66a507c2\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md\">../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Top}\">\\(\\mathrm{Top}\\)</span> (拓扑谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e7514bc4cefba4f2\" href=\"?note=e7514bc4cefba4f2\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-topology.md\">../batch14/58-df-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}_S\\)</span> (连续映射谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (乘积拓扑谓词, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"5260a5349d0b732f\" href=\"?note=5260a5349d0b732f\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md\">../batch05/58-df-zfc-top5-product-topology.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Barrel}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{Barrel}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span> (本文件定义的桶谓词)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_S(B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\tau_{EE},\\tau_{\\mathbb K E}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle E,E\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_E,\\tau_E\\rangle,E\\times E,\\tau_{EE})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle\\mathbb K,E\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\tau_E\\rangle,\\mathbb K\\times E,\\tau_{\\mathbb K E})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(+,E\\times E,\\tau_{EE},E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\odot,\\mathbb K\\times E,\\tau_{\\mathbb K E},E,\\tau_E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B\\subseteq E\n\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(x\\in\\{\\odot(\\langle r,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(+(\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\in B\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\left(|\\lambda|\\leq1\\to\\{\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\subseteq B\\right)\n\\land E\\setminus B\\in\\tau_E\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrel}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_S(B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot)\\leftrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathbb K\\in\\{\\mathbb R,\\mathbb C\\}\n\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_E,E)\\land\\mathrm{Top}(\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\mathbb K)\n\\land\\operatorname{VectorSpace}_{\\mathbb K}(E,+,\\odot)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists\\tau_{EE},\\tau_{\\mathbb K E}\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle E,E\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_E,\\tau_E\\rangle,E\\times E,\\tau_{EE})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop5ProductTopology}_S(2,\\langle\\mathbb K,E\\rangle,\\langle\\tau_{\\mathbb K},\\tau_E\\rangle,\\mathbb K\\times E,\\tau_{\\mathbb K E})\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(+,E\\times E,\\tau_{EE},E,\\tau_E)\n\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(\\odot,\\mathbb K\\times E,\\tau_{\\mathbb K E},E,\\tau_E)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land B\\subseteq E\n\\land\\forall x\\in E\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb R_{&gt;0}\\;\\left(x\\in\\{\\odot(\\langle r,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall x,y\\in B\\;\\forall t\\in[0,1]\\;\\left(+(\\langle\\odot(\\langle1-t,x\\rangle),\\odot(\\langle t,y\\rangle)\\rangle)\\in B\\right)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall\\lambda\\in\\mathbb K\\;\\left(|\\lambda|\\leq1\\to\\{\\odot(\\langle\\lambda,b\\rangle):b\\in B\\}\\subseteq B\\right)\n\\land E\\setminus B\\in\\tau_E\n\\end{aligned}\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrel\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau_E}(B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\;\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_S(B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}barrel\\text{-}compatible}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_{E,\\tau_E}(B)\\leftrightarrow\n\\exists\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot\\;\n\\mathrm{Barrel}_S(B,E,\\tau_E,\\mathbb K,\\tau_{\\mathbb K},+,\\odot)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Barrel: absolutely convex, absorbing, closed; &quot;nice&quot; neighborhoods</li>\n<li>桶型空间的定义（每个桶都是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span> 的邻域）应由独立原子给出，不属于本文件的桶定义。</li>\n<li>本断言把向量运算及其连续性显式纳入参数，再展开吸收、凸、平衡与闭四个条件。</li>\n<li>两个乘积拓扑由书内五元乘积拓扑谓词显式见证，不再用无来源的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\boxtimes\">\\(\\boxtimes\\)</span> 缩写。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Schaefer, Topological Vector Spaces</li>\n<li>Horvath, Topological Vector Spaces and Distributions</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-vector-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"592f9cfb66a507c2","